.DS_Store

# Superseded cut files and previews, set aside rather than deleted.
#
# Every cut-files/old/ holds sheets that a later regeneration replaced -- a
# different ply, a different kerf, a full-width cheek where the design is now
# narrow. They are kept on disk because a superseded sheet is still the only
# record of what a particular run drew, and untracked because they are a local
# archive rather than part of what this repository ships. git history before
# 2026-09-13 still holds every one of them.
#
# previews/old/ is the same set seen through make-preview.py, and moves with it.
#
# The pattern matches any directory named "old" at any depth, which is every
# one of them: twenty-one folders, 169 files.
old/
